The source-run stills and poster are independently reviewed and all 19 hosted media assets matched their versioned manifest by HTTP status, bytes and SHA-256. The current GitHub reader still has first-page limits and a PR end-date gap; this fictional capture does not validate provider retrieval or date-range fidelity. Actual paired motion footage, Cartesia narration, Remotion release films, timed captions, and a final film cover remain open.
